⸻

 Limitations

* Detection accuracy depends on the training dataset and model weights.
* Poor lighting, rain, fog, and occlusion may reduce detection performance.
* Real-time processing speed depends on the available hardware.
* Specialized detection tasks require appropriately trained YOLO11 models.
* This project is intended for academic research and prototyping, not certified vehicle safety use.

